<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TI" style="id">- Ibaas</book>
  <para style="h">2 ATimoti</para>
  <para style="toc3">2ATim</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 ATimoti</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kufumung kufɛ́ afa fɛ́ aBulus Jɛk sak na aTimoti</para>
  <para style="mt1">2 ATimoti</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kufumung kufɛ́ afaa fɛ́ aBulus <optbreak /> Jɛk sak na aTimoti</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TI 1" />
  <para style="s">Show yin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 1:1" />Kufumung kang ne ni imi aBulus, atom aYeso Kristi ni kushim Adakunom. Kpaf ni kushi isɛs kutset fi ku nes na Anet-Isheshek aYeso.<verse eid="2TI 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 1:2" />Sak na ari min aTimoti fin shim, won itek nɛ angmishish nɛ imen iyɛ fɛ́ a nes na Ada Adakunom nɛ Kristi aYeso aTisa yit na a sot ni ngɔn.<verse eid="2TI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ifeng ni ibarang agap</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 1:3" />In feng Adakunom fi in tsin ku ra mo kutomong ni iyɛ izining, kyɔn tɛ badakop hom kin ra. In yiring ni ngɔn kaaki izen kunom nɛ katuk ayɛt awon hom. <verse eid="2TI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 1:4" />Ki in yiring na nayisi ngɔn, na di se kin in mi da di, nɔng ifeng hom da shining. <verse eid="2TI 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 1:5" />Ba mi di yiring na atitup inɔɔk atsak ngɔn, ayɔng fɛ́ a kin tun ne ni nggɔkɔp ngɔn aLowis, ni nggɔ ngɔn aYunis, fi in bi nɔɔk atsak fok a se ayɛt ngɔn bá. <verse eid="2TI 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 1:6" />Nek anɔng, in tsin da yiring e, fok ni fesem kunang fɛ́ Adakunom mi da nɔɔk, ma ku ta kurong, fi ngɔn mi se ni izen fi in di sak mbɔk hom ni ngɔn. <verse eid="2TI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 1:7" />Nek Adakunom ki nɔɔk yit kabik nnyim awo, tit kabik agap, ni ishim, ni iyit ice.<verse eid="2TI 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 1:8" />Nek anɔng, i bi fok nsum icɛɛt naton aTisa yit awo, ke ni fok nsum icɛɛt naton hom afi inyang nek iwu awo. Tit moon ice ni imi ayɛt mgbang nek ishara ifɛ̀ itek, ayɛt agap fɛ́ a nes na Adakunom. <verse eid="2TI 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 1:9" />Iwu fɛ́ a ki sheshek yit, a ki yes yit sak ni kusot ajɛrɛ, da nek ikyikak itek fi in nye yit awo, tit nek inye wu, ni itek wu. Ba ki nɔk yit itek e deng na Anet-Isheshek aYeso neme ni itumung izen. <verse eid="2TI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 1:10" />Awɛt yɔkɔnɔng, ba mi ki tonong yit ide ni kubɛ́ Anet-Isheshek yit aYeso Kristi, iwu fɛ́ a mi fɛlɛ iku, a mi bɛ ni kutset nɛ avit iku wɛshɛk ayɛt ifɛ̀ itek. <verse eid="2TI 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 1:11" />A yet nek Ifɛ̀ itek e me deng wu fɛ́ ba di kasa mo mok ni in sot anet itom nɛ atom aYeso nɛ anet itees. <verse eid="2TI 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 1:12" />Nek anɔng wu in tsin sɔ izot yɔkɔnɔng. Ngma na anɔng, in tsin fok nsum awo, nek imi rēn ayɔng fi in di nɔɔk atsak, in rēn ayɛt iyɛ hom fok iwu kyɛm na a tekap ikyɛng fi imi nabak ni bɔk wu sak ni kunom e yɔng.<verse eid="2TI 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 1:13" />Ikyɛng fi ngɔn mi fok ni mi, won ni i sot itees atsak ni ngɔn, gung na atsak ni ishim fi i se ayɛt Anet-Isheshek aYeso. <verse eid="2TI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 1:14" />Bereng ikyɛng itek fɛ́ ba mi ituus ayɛt iyɛ ngɔn fɛ́ ba mi da nabak e, bereng iye ayɛt igbingding Kabik aJɛrɛ fɛ́ ka se ayɛt yit.<verse eid="2TI 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 1:15" />Ngɔn rēn fok, kaangan ni mben Asiya mi di wobok, ngma na ba aFayijelus, nɛ aHamojenis.<verse eid="2TI 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 1:16" />Won Adakunom na a tonong angmishish sak na bafɛ́ ari aOnesiforus, nek a di na di sɛs mo izen izen, a fok nsum inyang hom awo. <verse eid="2TI 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 1:17" />Aza anɔng, ni izen fɛ́ a bɛ na aRoma, a bɔrɔng i di tsɛt, ma a di sɛ ninyɛn. <verse eid="2TI 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 1:18" />Won Adakunom na a sak na a sɛ angmishish aTisa atuk e yɔng! Ngɔn rēn tsɛngtsɛng irèn dot fi in mi sɛs igbingding ni wu ni imi mo na Afisa.<verse eid="2TI 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TI 2" />
  <para style="s">Atsom atek afɛ́ Anet-Isheshek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 2:1" />Di, arim hom, nyeseng gak nek itek fi in bɛ̀ yit ayɛt aYeso Kristi. <verse eid="2TI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 2:2" />Ngma nkyɔrɔk fi ngɔn mi foos in cɛɛt ashon banet dot, naban ina na bayɔng fɛ́ ba di ki te iyɛ ni ba, fɛ́ ba da tees bakak e bà. <verse eid="2TI 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 2:3" />Sok kabak kafɔɔn kafi mgbang e sot atsom atek afɛ́ aYeso Kristi. <verse eid="2TI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 2:4" />Vit atsom fɛ́ a se na kabung kutomong wu, fɛ́ a kana yising na tse na ras kusot kukak zɛɛt, tit na nye ikyɛng fi i da tɛrɛk atekari wu iyɛ. <verse eid="2TI 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 2:5" />Kpaf anɔng bà, vit anet fɛ́ a se ayɛt kuro itsi, fɛ́ a da kyɛm a ya kunang e, tit ma a kuus ntsi kuro me. <verse eid="2TI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 2:6" />I se yɛɛt anet ikap fɛ́ a kana bung ayɛt kutomong wu, na tun ya kutsin mbɔk wu. <verse eid="2TI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 2:7" />Yiring ni ikyɛng fi in tsin da taas, nek aTisa da ka nɔɔk ice irēn naton nkyɔrɔk e ngma.<verse eid="2TI 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 2:8" />Yiring na aYeso Kristi fɛ́ ba ku donong ni rɛk, afi izit agwɔm aDauda. Nek anɔng fi in di shara ifɛ̀ itek deng. <verse eid="2TI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 2:9" />I yet nek ishara ifɛ̀ itek e deng fi i sak in tsin sɔ izoot, in di se ari inyang tɛ anet inɛn. Awɛt Ifɛ̀ Adakunom da ba kyɛm ba rosom ide ni inyang awo. <verse eid="2TI 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 2:10" />Nek anɔng fi in di te gbinding na kaaki ikyɛng nek bayɔng fɛ́ Adakunom mi kasa. Nɔng ba bin sɛ kutset vit igang nek aYeso Kristi, ni inɔ ayɛt ízɔk fi i se avit nkum.<verse eid="2TI 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 2:11" />Ifɛ̀ deng yet atsak ye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:11">Ki in ku yit gung ni wu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:11">in da sot yit batset</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:11">gung ni wu bà.<verse eid="2TI 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 2:12" />Ki in te gbinding yit,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:12">in bi ya yit igwɔm</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:12">gung ni wu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:12">Ki in ku toon yit,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:12">a bi ki toon yit bà.<verse eid="2TI 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 2:13" />Ki iyit shinishi yit ikyɛng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:13">fi in taas yit awo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:13">iwu shinishi ikyɛng fɛ́ a taas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:13">nek iwu kyɛm a toone</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:13">ni ice wu awo.<verse eid="2TI 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Anet kutomong fɛ́ <optbreak /> Adakunom di te iyɛ ni wu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 2:14" />Man ni ka ba yiring e nkyɔrɔk nang, ni ka ba kɔrɔk kuto nanu shon Adakunom fok, da ba bi ras nanan abap naton Ifɛ̀ awo, nek da i bɛ́ ni itek awo, tit ni beseng bafi foos e kyɛk. <verse eid="2TI 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 2:15" />Te nyɛk nɔng i da bin sɛ ishan nanu shon Adakunom, tɛ anet itomong fɛ́ da a fok nsum kutomong wu awo, na tees Ifɛ̀ atsak kpaf. <verse eid="2TI 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 2:16" />I bi te ice ngɔn ni ncɛɛt abap in fi ibyɛs sak na Adakunom awo, nek anɔng e bang sas banet e na ba wey hwyii ni irèn ikuus. <verse eid="2TI 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 2:17" />Itees ba me se tɛ agbɛng-nkanang fi kuya kurɔm ngma kusum. Ayɛt ba yet aHimeniyus nɛ aPiletus, <verse eid="2TI 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 2:18" />iba fɛ́ ba mi won irèn ikuus ba, nek ba nye na banet fok idoro bafaben e mi tsang got. Anɔng e mi buruk bakak ni inɔɔk atsak bá. <verse eid="2TI 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 2:19" />Awɛt itis fɛ́ Adakunom ta ide, vit ikyɛng fi i da kyɛm i te digit ide awo. I se ni jɛk ye, &lt;&lt;ATisa rēn bayɔng fɛ́ ba yet bafuu,&gt;&gt; nɛ, &lt;&lt;Won ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a nye fok, iwu yet afɛ́ aTisa, won na wosong iras nkyɔrɔk nmaane.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2TI 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 2:20" />Ari karatek ba sɛs nkyɔrɔk zizɛɛt: nkak yet nfɛ́ atsɔm asɛng, akak yet nfɛ́ atsɔm akan, akak yet nfɛ́ ákon, akak yet nfi irɔp, akak yet afi ntomong ibyɛs, nɛ akak yet afi ntomong ntek. <verse eid="2TI 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 2:21" />Ngma anet fɛ́ a kanang ice wu yik-yik ni ikyɛng ibyɛs, a da sot ti ikyɛng fɛ́ ba di ki ra kutomong kutek ni wu, ba mi ku sak jɛrɛ, ikyɛng fɛ́ atekari tsɛt, a mi kana nye nek ira kaakyi kutomong kutek.<verse eid="2TI 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 2:22" />Teng ngɔn imaan ikɔk fɛ́ bacam tsɛt, di kuus kusot kutabat, ni kusot abik, ni ishim, ni imen nhwyɛ na bayɔng fɛ́ ba yes aTisa ni iyɛ ikan. <verse eid="2TI 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2TI 2:23" />Da ikyikak bi da moon ni nggɔn ishɔp nɛ nanan fɛ́ na se vit ice me awo, nek ngɔn rēn na bes ni ifa. <verse eid="2TI 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2TI 2:24" />I se gyat na ba sɛ asam Adakunom ayɛt ifa awo; tit, na a bɛ́ nggɔn ntek sak na banet ngma, na a kyem itees banet, na a sot anet akabɔk. <verse eid="2TI 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2TI 2:25" />Bayɔng fɛ́ ba ku raba, na a ka ba tees hwyɛ, ni ite iyɛ fok Adakunom bi ka ba sak na ba won anɛn bà na ba tirik sak irēn atsak, <verse eid="2TI 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2TI 2:26" />nɔng na ba bi nɔ ni in nhwyɛ bà na ba wuruk ayɛt agunung aShetan fɛ́ a mi ka ba tekap nɔng ba da nye kushim wu.<verse eid="2TI 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TI 3" />
  <para style="s">Kusot ni nnom igang e</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 3:1" />Rēn fok, ni nnom igang e ba bi sɔ izot makiyi. <verse eid="2TI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 3:2" />Banet bi sot bafi ishim ice, bafi ishim itsɔm, bafi itsot kugwɔm, bafi iceshek ice, bafi itok, bafi kugbarak ice na batek bá, bafɛ́ vit ifeng, bafɛ́ vit inyim Adakunom <verse eid="2TI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 3:3" />na bafɛ́ vit ishim. Bafɛ́ vit ifuut anɛn bafidang, bafi ibeseng iyerek bafidang, bafɛ́ vit iyit ice, bafi anyas, na bafi ifup ni ikyɛng fi i yet itek, <verse eid="2TI 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 3:4" />bafi ya kushi, bafɛ́ vit ira ikyɛng hwyɛ, bayɔng fi ikok ice mi ka ba shining. Bafi ishim ifoos ice bá nta aza ishim Adakunom, <verse eid="2TI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 3:5" />ba tonong ice bá fok ba yet bafi kuus Adakunom, awɛt ni kusonong bá ba toon ni kukyem de. I bi won ikikak i da moon ni kuri banet bang awo.<verse eid="2TI 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 3:6" />Bakak ayɛt bá nɔɔs na nasa banet, na ba sɔ ice banyining yɔng fɛ́ da ba bɛ̀ agap ni kusot bá awo, fɛ́ anɛn mi ka ba sɔ ice, ayɛ bá mi shining ni nkyɔrɔk nmaane zizɛɛt. <verse eid="2TI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 3:7" />Iba banyining e bang, kaaki izen ba se ayɛt imɛɛs akabɛs, awɛt da ba ne ba rēn atsak e awo. <verse eid="2TI 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 3:8" />Kyɔn tɛ aJanes, nɛ aJambiris fɛ́ ba nɔɔk aMusa kama, anɔng fɛ́ banet ban nɔɔk kama na atsak e. Iyiring ba yet nmaane, inɔɔk atsak bá sot ifɛ́ abap. <verse eid="2TI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 3:9" />Awɛt ba da kyɛm ba ta yik-yik awo, nek ayɛt kizen hyiit kaangan da wat a di ishɔp bá dɛt-dɛt, kpaf ti fi ite na ba aJanes nɛ aJamberes.<verse eid="2TI 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Itees ifi igang e</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 3:10" />Awɛt ngɔn aTimoti, yɔkɔnɔng i mi rēn itees hom, ni nse hom, ni ra ikyɛng fi in di bi ite iyɛ, ni inɔɔk atsak hom, nɛ kabɔk hom, ni ishim hom, ni ite gbinding hom. <verse eid="2TI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 3:11" />Ngɔn rēn kuri izot ni mgbang yɔng fi in sɔ na Antakiya, ni aIkoniyum, nɛ aListira, ngma ne anɔng in te gbinding, aTisa di sheshek ayɛt na ngma. <verse eid="2TI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 3:12" />Atsak e yet, ngma anet fe a shim a nye ikyɛng fɛ́ Adakunom shim ayɛt aYeso Kristi, i se gbing-gbing na a sɔ izot. <verse eid="2TI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 3:13" />Awɛt bafi anyas, na bafi iwɔrɔsɔ banet bang risik ayɛt anyas bá, na ba wɔrɔsɔ bakak, na bakak ka ba wɔrɔsɔ bà.<verse eid="2TI 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 3:14" />Awɛt ngɔn, ya kashon ni ikyɛng fi imɛɛs, ni bereng inɔɔk atsak ngɔn gak, nek ngɔn rēn bayɔng fi i mi di mɛɛs ide ni bá. <verse eid="2TI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 3:15" />Yiring neme fi ngɔn yet nggon, i mi tsang rēn Ifɛ̀ Kufumung Adakunom kufɛ́ ajɛrɛ. Kufumung e sak i di sot tsɛngtsɛng, i da tonong irèn isheshek fi ines ni irèn inɔɔk atsak na aYeso Kristi. <verse eid="2TI 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 3:16" />Ngma ijɛk Ifɛ̀ Kufumung Adakunom yet nsong Adakunom, i se yɛɛt nek itees atsak, ni igyɔng, ni nye nse, ni itees kusot kutabat, <verse eid="2TI 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 3:17" />nɔng ngma anet Adakunom bin sɛ ishining, na ma kana nye gyat nek kaakyɛ kuri kutomong kutek.<verse eid="2TI 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2TI 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 4:1" />In tsin da nɔk agbat ifɛ̀ deng na anu shon Adakunom nɛ aYeso Kristi, ayɔng fɛ́ a bi ra bayɔng fɛ́ ba se ni kutset ni nkom ishɔt, a bi tɛ bun na ya igwɔm. <verse eid="2TI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 4:2" />Te nyɛk ni ishara Ifɛ̀ Adakunom, kɛ na kawat a, ke vit kawat ayi. Ka ba tonong iburuk bá, ka ba gyɔng, ka ba tabak ayɛt kuhwyɛ, ni itees. <verse eid="2TI 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 4:3" />Nek izen bi bɛ́ fɛ́ banet da shim iwees ato ni itees atsak awo, tit ikyɛng fɛ́ ayɛ bá shim kyɛk, ni ikyɛng fɛ́ ato bá hwyaan ni ifoos e. Nek anɔng, ba tusung ace bà na banet itees fɛ́ ba da ka ba taas ikyɛng fɛ́ iba shim ifoos e. <verse eid="2TI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 4:4" />Banet bi raba ikuus atsak, ba bi wees ato ni nkyɛng-ashon. <verse eid="2TI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 4:5" />Awɛt ingɔn, tekap ice ngɔn ayɛt akaakyɛ ikyɛng, te gbinding ayɛt izoot, ra kutomong anet ishara ifɛ̀ itek, ra kaakyɛ kuri kutomong isam na Adakunom.<verse eid="2TI 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 4:6" />Awɛt imi, izen hom mi nye fɛ́ ba da ki nabak tɛ inabak-akuce anu shon Adakunom. Nek izen fi in da won kutset kang mi bɛ́ bakat. <verse eid="2TI 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 4:7" />In mi ra itsom hom itek, in mi gang i tsi hom yɛɛt, in mi gang i tsi hom gyat, in bereng inɔɔk atsak hom gyat sak ni igang e. <verse eid="2TI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 4:8" />Yɔkɔnɔng ana, izang kusot kutabat hom tsin di tot fɛ́ aTisa, anet ishɔt atsak ba di nɔk ni kunom e yɔng. Da imi azi hom kyɛk awo, awɛt ngma na bayɔng fɛ́ ba bi iya iyɛ ni tot kubun wu.<verse eid="2TI 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kucɛɛt kufi igang e</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 4:9" />Te nyɛk da bɛ́ ni imi ziri, <verse eid="2TI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 4:10" />nek aDemas mi di wobok nek ishim nkyɔrɔk azatse nang, a tseng sak na aTesaloni, na aKirzens tseng sak na aGalati, na aTitus tseng sak na aDalmatiya. <verse eid="2TI 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 4:11" />ALuka wu kyɛk fɛ́ a se gung ni imi. Tsɛt aMarkus da bɛ́ yin gung, nek a di sɛs mo ni kutomong. <verse eid="2TI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 4:12" />In tom aTikikus sak na Afisa. <verse eid="2TI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 4:13" />Izen fi i da bɛ́ ni i di bereng mo kutukusuk kukpin hom fi in won ni bɔk aKabus na aTorowas, na afumung ifa hom, imakmak e kufi ijɛk yɔng fɛ́ ba nye iko na akpa.<verse eid="2TI 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 4:14" />Alekzanda fɛ́ a yet atu di nye anyas gyet awo, aTisa bi ku tarang izang ikyɛng fɛ́ a di nye ne. <verse eid="2TI 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 4:15" />Ngɔn bà, nye hwyɛ ni wu, nek a ra ifup ni ifɛ̀ yit gyet awo.<verse eid="2TI 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 4:16" />Ni imɛsɛng e fi in da tɛnɛng ice hom na anu shon ishɔt, vit anet fɛ́ a run kama hom, ngma bá ba di wobok. Won Adakunom na a fa nkyɔrɔk nang naton ace bá awo. <verse eid="2TI 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 4:17" />Awɛt aTisa di sɛ mo, a di nɔk agap, in kyɛm in shara Ifɛ̀ wu yɛɛt sak ni Ícɛn-iduk, na ba fok Ifɛ̀ me bà. A tɛ di sheshek nanu akukum. <verse eid="2TI 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 4:18" />ATisa di ki sheshek ayɛt kaakyɛ kuri imaan e, a da tseng ni imi kyang sak ni igwɔm wu na azanɛn. Won iratek ni sot ifuu ayɛ na ayɛ! Anɔng.<verse eid="2TI 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ashow afi igang e</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 4:19" />Di nye show aPrisila na Akwila, na bafɛ́ asa aOnesiforus. <verse eid="2TI 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 4:20" />Arastus rēn resek mo na aKorinti, in won aTurofimus ni rɔk na aMiletus. <verse eid="2TI 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 4:21" />Te nyɛk i da bɛ́ gyam dang abolosh na nye. AYubulus, nɛ aPudins, nɛ aLayinus, nɛ aKalayudiya, ni ishɛrɛp baruneng da nye show. <verse eid="2TI 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 4:22" />Won aTisa na se gung na kabik ngɔn. Won itek wu ni se gung ni yin.<verse eid="2TI 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 4" />
</usx>